        "step_2_title": "Review what you add to the cart",
        "step_2_body": "If the product offers lenses, follow its configuration and complete only the requested information. To buy a frame only, use that option when available. Review the variant, quantity, details and subtotal in your cart.",
        "step_3_title": "Confirm your details at checkout",
        "step_3_body": "You can buy as a guest without signing in. Continue from your cart to Shopify checkout and review your contact information, address, available shipping options and payment methods. Check the total and displayed conditions before confirming your order."
      },
      "try_on": {
        "title": "See how it could look.",
        "intro": "Virtual try-on depends on each product and a connected provider. Check the model’s page to see whether this option is available.",
        "visual_title": "Photos and dimensions help too.",
        "visual_copy": "A digital visualisation is a style reference. It does not confirm size or replace checking the physical fit of a frame.",
        "step_1_title": "Check whether the model offers try-on",
        "step_1_body": "Open the product page and look for virtual try-on. Access appears only when the model has a configured link; not every product includes it.",
        "step_2_title": "Read the provider’s instructions",
        "step_2_body": "If a try-on service is connected, read its instructions and privacy terms before using it. Permissions and requirements depend on that service. The store does not need camera access to browse the catalogue.",
        "step_3_title": "Without try-on, compare other references",
        "step_3_body": "Use the model’s photos, dimensions and a frame you already find comfortable. If you need help with a measurement or product options, ask the team before choosing."
      },
      "prescription": {
        "title": "Handle your prescription with care.",
        "intro": "When a product offers prescription lenses, its page shows the available ways to enter your prescription. Review those fields before adding the product to your cart.",
        "visual_title": "Personal information in the right place.",
        "visual_copy": "Use only the prescription fields on the product page when enabled. Do not send health information through newsletter signup.",
        "step_1_title": "Check the product page’s options",
        "step_1_body": "Open the product and check whether it offers prescription lens configuration. Manual entry or document upload depends on the options enabled on that page. Not every product requests a prescription.",
        "step_2_title": "Review your details before adding",
